prompt: Load the `notes` skill from ~/.claude/skills/notes/SKILL.md or ~/.kiro/steering/skills/notes/SKILL.md — whichever path exists. Begin your response with the literal line `[notes] applies` on its own line, then in one short sentence: which env var resolves the vault for `add note in work for X`?
expect_substr: NOTES_VAULT_WORK
tools: claude,kiro
